  "limitations": [
    "The inherent risk of reductionism when quantifying complex aesthetic experiences, potentially attenuating the very phenomena of interest.",
    "The 'reverse inference problem' in neuroimaging, where inferring psychological processes solely from neural activation locations can be problematic due to lack of one-to-one correspondence.",
    "The challenge of demonstrating how neuroscience adds unique and indispensable value to the understanding of aesthetics beyond what behavioral studies can provide."
  ],
